# 2.1.3.1 <<Quotation List Screen>>

## a. UI Specifications

### <<Quotation List Screen>>

**Brief Description:**

This screen displays a list of all quotations in the system. It allows Sales Staff and Director to search, filter, monitor quotation status, and perform quick actions such as viewing details, updating status, and printing quotation.

